#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD0089 expect=noViolation domain=TE
#note "Row 1 populates TEENRL, row 2 populates TEDUR, row 3 populates both -> every element satisfies 'at least one of TEENRL or TEDUR should be populated'."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TE label="Trial Elements"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col ETCD    type=Char label="Element Code"
col ELEMENT type=Char label="Description of Element"
col TESTRL  type=Char label="Rule for Start of Element"
col TEENRL  type=Char label="Rule for End of Element"
col TEDUR   type=Char label="Planned Duration of Element"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | TE | SCRN | Screening | Informed consent | End of screening |
CDISCPILOT01 | TE | TRT  | Treatment | First dose       |                  | P14D
CDISCPILOT01 | TE | FUP  | Follow-up | Last dose        | End of follow-up | P28D
